  "conclusion": "No blocking findings within the stated exact-source scopes. Frozen900 full-workspace05 completed with 6253 passing tests, no failed/ignored/filtered tests, and explicit exit0; strict Clippy/fmt02 evidence was already accepted. Release and formal profile/matrix remain pending, and external source-review scopes are not substituted.",
  "cross_consumer_binding": [
    "Semantic Store load/decode_bound returns raw TypedProgram/CandidatePlan after current source binding, never a VerifiedModule. project.rs wraps restored candidate as TypedInput::CachedProgram and calls finish_typed.",
    "finish_typed obtains the current raw candidate from the query, checks cancellation, invokes typed.verify(candidate, current options, current VerifySession), and only publishes the successful verification session after the current call returns successfully.",
    "TypedInput::verify passes current Module/Program Arc and current Candidate Arc plus current target and complete Limits into the independent Verify entry. Shared row arrays or Analyze public fingerprints do not grant authority.",
    "Only the resulting current VerifiedModule feeds lower_view; build_view_with_cancellation_and_session receives that same current verified value and resulting LIR, current build configuration and bound stable source names.",
    "RawFunctionPlanEncoding still binds complete row equality, not only two array pointers or Analyze summary. COW protects retained nested block/hold data. Existing aggregate node/byte insufficiency falls back at the original encoding position; current global plan headers/suffix remain encoded."
  ],
